WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.792 --> 00:00:17.748
Gasser slammed into the junk pile.

2
00:00:17.748 --> 00:00:20.302
Smash!

3
00:00:20.302 --> 00:00:23.191
Brumm, brumm!

4
00:00:23.192 --> 00:00:26.096
Gasser drove over the pile.

5
00:00:26.097 --> 00:00:29.092
"Whoa!" Eddy said.

6
00:00:29.093 --> 00:00:31.574
Crack! Crunch!

7
00:00:31.574 --> 00:00:35.081
Parts twisted and broke.

8
00:00:35.082 --> 00:00:39.955
Gasser drove up a bigger pile.

9
00:00:39.963 --> 00:00:46.574
"Yay!" Dipper cheered.

10
00:00:46.575 --> 00:00:49.687
"Listen to this," said Gasser.

11
00:00:49.688 --> 00:00:53.167
He closed his eyes.

12
00:00:53.167 --> 00:00:58.062
He took a deep breath.

13
00:00:58.062 --> 00:01:01.899
Brumm, brumm, brumm!

14
00:01:01.900 --> 00:01:05.171
Gasser's engine roared.

15
00:01:05.172 --> 00:01:08.406
"Wow!" Eddy said.

16
00:01:08.406 --> 00:01:15.496
"That was super loud!"

17
00:01:15.497 --> 00:01:18.862
"Let's play!" Dipper said.

18
00:01:18.862 --> 00:01:29.643
The friends played hide-and-seek.

19
00:01:29.644 --> 00:01:38.468
Next they played tag.

20
00:01:38.469 --> 00:01:44.082
Then they told jokes.

21
00:01:44.083 --> 00:01:46.928
It was getting late.

22
00:01:46.928 --> 00:01:59.378
"Good-bye, Gasser," Eddy said.

23
00:01:59.379 --> 00:02:04.303
The friends drove home.

24
00:02:04.303 --> 00:02:08.168
Everyone was sad.

25
00:02:08.169 --> 00:02:11.454
"Gasser is cool," Jeb said.

26
00:02:11.455 --> 00:02:20.332
"Will we ever see him again?"
